ng I don’t let it inside"},{"s":82.7,"e":85.62,"text":"Thoughts on commandments emotions can pass Clouds cross"},{"s":85.62,"e":88.02,"text":"the heavens but heaven still lasts Watch mine"},{"s":88.02,"e":90.08,"text":"awake with my values in view God show"},{"s":90.08,"e":91.72,"text":"me the good and the next thing to"},{"s":91.72,"e":93.46,"text":"do If the clock strikes nine then I"},{"s":93.46,"e":95.98,"text":"start my design If distraction appears I return"},{"s":95.98,"e":97.82,"text":"to the light If the mountain feels massive"},{"s":97.88,"e":100.16,"text":"one stone will be fine Little faithful action"},{"s":100.16,"e":104.44,"text":"make the future alive Five eight nine Let"},{"s":104.44,"e":109.08,"text":"the light realign God in my spirit and"},{"s":109.08,"e":111.6,"text":"a goal in my mind Five eighty nine"},{"s":111.6,"e":114.8,"text":"percent Joyful event Not a measured miracle Mighty"},{"s":114.8,"e":117.46,"text":"intent I pray then plan I believe then"},{"s":117.44,"e":119.64,"text":"begin Grace is the ground But I still"},{"s":119.64,"e":124.04,"text":"got a grin Five eight nine I’m feeling"},{"s":124.04,"e":130.84,"text":"divine Happy and productive one purpose at a"},{"s":130.84,"e":134.38,"text":"time Five things Thank Him Eight breaths Take"},{"s":134.38,"e":140.22,"text":"them Nine steps Make them Wake up Amen"},{"s":140.24,"e":142.22,"text":"Plan it Pursue it Pause and renew it"},{"s":142.52,"e":144.2,"text":"Love is the reason so rise up and"},{"s":144.2,"e":144.68,"text":"do it"},{"s":146.22,"e":148.5,"text":"Phone face down let the focus flow free"},{"s":148.78,"e":150.84,"text":"One sacred task for the future of me"},{"s":151.2,"e":153.54,"text":"25 working and rest of my sight Brief"},{"s":153.54,"e":155.6,"text":"breaks bring bigger good sleep Brings the light"},{"s":155.98,"e":158.54,"text":"Give to my neighbor call somebody close Joy"},{"s":158.54,"e":160.9,"text":"multiplies when we give what matters most Serve"},{"s":160.9,"e":1